The most important part is to find the down staircase.  Then you
may explore the rest of the dungeon level.  By *explore* I mean
just go through the hallways and pass, but *not* search, the rooms.
If you have an idea about the locations of the rooms on the level
and of some important interconnections between them, descend deeper.

I strongly suggest to play some games in explore mode to get some
feeling about how the dungeons are generated.  Choose a Tourist
and wish for some more scrolls of magic mapping.  Observe where
secret doors are located.

