Nethack is different compared to other games where you *have* to
find an "important item", a key, a spell, whatever.  In Nethack
it is not necessary to find every thing lying around, and it is
also not advisable to take everything you find.  You don't know
whether things you find are good or bad, you will have to make
decisions what is worth to carry to somehow sometimes somewhere
identify this loot.

Change your gameplay and you will enjoy the game much more.

